WEBVTT

00:21.560 --> 00:22.890
I'm sleepy-

00:25.730 --> 00:28.940
I believe you're Jubei Kibagami.

00:29.730 --> 00:32.330
It must be a coincidence
to have met you here.

00:32.360 --> 00:35.530
I want you to work for me.

00:35.860 --> 00:37.660
- Of course, I will pay you.
- No.

00:42.870 --> 00:44.000
Hey, Genza.

00:44.670 --> 00:47.500
What's it like out there?

00:49.090 --> 00:50.090
Not much.

00:50.750 --> 00:54.380
No matter where you go, people
are people, and the sky is the sky.

00:55.180 --> 00:57.510
Nothing's different.

00:58.050 --> 00:59.050
I'm...

03:03.680 --> 03:07.100
Everyone is dead.

03:17.980 --> 03:19.240
I'm...

03:32.250 --> 03:36.670
<i>Episode 2 Departure.</i>

03:48.350 --> 03:52.230
You're in a
pathetic state, Roga.

03:58.280 --> 04:02.950
I will let you live for now.

04:03.490 --> 04:07.740
<i>Raga... answer me.</i>

04:08.830 --> 04:12.540
Who attacked the
Light Maiden's village?

04:14.210 --> 04:16.960
The Kimon Clan...

04:17.790 --> 04:20.050
What happened to
the Light Maiden?

04:20.550 --> 04:22.890
She ran away.

04:22.920 --> 04:25.730
I don't know where
in the world she is.

04:25.760 --> 04:29.360
Where is the Sacred
Dragon Stone?

04:29.390 --> 04:32.020
Did you give it to
the Light Maiden?

04:33.440 --> 04:35.770
JubeL...

04:36.190 --> 04:39.780
Jubei Kibagami.

04:40.860 --> 04:42.750
Jubei?

04:42.780 --> 04:44.540
What's he like?

04:44.570 --> 04:46.700
Tell me what he looks like.

04:56.790 --> 04:59.000
All of you, listen up.

05:02.090 --> 05:04.800
Look for this face.

05:05.340 --> 05:11.060
Search for Jubei Kibagami.

05:25.860 --> 05:29.910
What a nuisance this is.

05:49.550 --> 05:50.640
Only the wind.

06:26.460 --> 06:27.690
<i>Ouch!</i>

06:27.720 --> 06:31.570
<i>If we ever get attacked, we
can barely defend our village.</i>

06:31.600 --> 06:33.310
<i>You're right.</i>

06:35.430 --> 06:38.560
<i>I don't care who-
someone defeat me!</i>

06:42.060 --> 06:47.070
All in all, I had no idea...

06:55.540 --> 06:56.540
Genza...

06:57.500 --> 06:58.660
Everyone...

07:48.300 --> 07:53.430
Oh, I see... You
found the Light Maiden.

08:05.440 --> 08:10.410
<i>I am letting her go
for now. Please wait.</i>

08:10.440 --> 08:14.540
<i>PLAYBACK I will
definitely bring her to you.</i>

08:14.570 --> 08:20.120
<i>PLAYBACK RECORDING</i>
Don't fail this time.

08:20.540 --> 08:25.010
Lord Yamikubo will not
accept another failure.

08:25.040 --> 08:26.500
Understand?

08:28.460 --> 08:30.090
<i>RECORDING COMPLETE.</i>

08:40.850 --> 08:44.480
The Light Maiden and
the Sacred Dragon Stone.

08:44.890 --> 08:47.330
When those two become one,

08:47.360 --> 08:50.530
the Hiruko treasures
will be unlocked.

08:59.490 --> 09:01.970
Wh-What do you mean?

09:02.000 --> 09:04.430
You're going to charge
me extra from here on in?

09:04.460 --> 09:06.180
You never told me that!

09:06.210 --> 09:08.890
Of course I never told you that!

09:08.920 --> 09:09.970
What?

09:10.000 --> 09:14.690
This is a dangerous area
full of thieves and bandits.

09:14.720 --> 09:18.480
And I am guiding you with
this heavy stuff on my back.

09:18.510 --> 09:21.110
So, extra charge.

09:21.140 --> 09:22.390
You...!

09:22.890 --> 09:26.320
You're telling me that what
I paid you isn't enough?!

09:26.350 --> 09:28.530
Not nearly enough!

09:28.560 --> 09:30.860
You...!

09:31.520 --> 09:34.620
You! Who do you think I am?

09:34.650 --> 09:37.540
I have a master's license in
Kashima Munen swordsmanship!

09:37.570 --> 09:40.920
You're the kind who only
paid for the license, right?

09:40.950 --> 09:44.050
You better stop now,
or you're gonna get hurt.

09:44.080 --> 09:47.960
You brat!

09:49.040 --> 09:50.810
Careful, Mr. Samurai.

09:50.840 --> 09:52.840
Watch your feet.

09:57.800 --> 10:00.720
Uh-oh! Mr. Samurai!

10:06.600 --> 10:07.600
Crap.

10:07.730 --> 10:10.560
He's got nothing valuable.

10:13.570 --> 10:15.830
Ah! Something smells nice.

10:15.860 --> 10:16.950
Don't be impudent!

10:17.400 --> 10:21.030
Hmm, you're some beauty.

10:21.740 --> 10:25.880
Do you think you can get
away with doing such a thing?

10:25.910 --> 10:27.180
Of course I do.

10:27.210 --> 10:28.800
A man needs to survive.

10:28.830 --> 10:29.830
What?!

10:30.750 --> 10:32.760
You'd better watch out yourself.

10:32.790 --> 10:36.430
This place is full of
thieves and bandits.

10:36.460 --> 10:38.340
Someone as beautiful
as you will be...

10:42.430 --> 10:46.100
That's it! I'm going
to sell you off!

10:46.470 --> 10:49.140
How dare you! Come!

10:55.320 --> 10:58.110
Hand us that woman.

11:02.530 --> 11:06.260
What a beauty!

11:06.290 --> 11:08.750
Hand her over to us now, kid!

11:09.210 --> 11:10.760
You dirty scoundrels!

11:10.790 --> 11:12.430
Okay, it's all yours.

11:12.460 --> 11:13.880
Here we go!

11:18.300 --> 11:20.590
Not the helmet, the girl!

11:25.890 --> 11:26.990
Let me go!

11:27.020 --> 11:28.400
I don't need your help!

11:28.430 --> 11:30.190
That's not what it is.

11:30.560 --> 11:33.190
You're my catch!

11:36.900 --> 11:38.290
Don't kill her.

11:38.320 --> 11:39.530
She's worth a lot!

11:51.160 --> 11:52.680
What do you want,
you crummy old priest?

11:52.710 --> 11:54.850
What do you want?

11:54.880 --> 11:57.800
This is what I want.

12:15.100 --> 12:16.690
I guess I shall go.

12:31.540 --> 12:34.970
Priest, thank you very
much for helping me.

12:35.000 --> 12:36.430
Quite all right.

12:36.460 --> 12:38.930
Hey, aren't you
going to thank me?

12:38.960 --> 12:40.980
You are a criminal.

12:41.010 --> 12:42.470
What?

12:44.630 --> 12:47.680
This priest is just as shady.

12:47.970 --> 12:52.140
First of all, an ordinary priest
wouldn't use a smoke bomb.

12:53.310 --> 12:55.100
I wonder.

12:56.190 --> 12:58.910
Young lady, where
are you headed?

12:58.940 --> 13:02.030
It is dangerous to travel alone.

13:02.530 --> 13:03.670
I don't know.

13:03.700 --> 13:05.670
Our village was burnt down.

13:05.700 --> 13:07.410
Everyone was killed.

13:08.660 --> 13:10.120
Inn-

13:10.870 --> 13:14.460
I have no idea what
I'm going to do now.

13:15.460 --> 13:17.670
Then, let me tell you.

13:25.510 --> 13:27.930
What in the hell is this?

13:28.220 --> 13:29.940
Southeast Asian artifice...

13:29.970 --> 13:31.690
A mechanical doll.

13:31.720 --> 13:32.930
Mechanical doll?

13:33.390 --> 13:37.150
It seems like someone's
trying to get you.

13:38.400 --> 13:42.200
Most likely, you are the reason
why they attacked your village.

13:42.230 --> 13:43.620
Why?

13:43.650 --> 13:48.700
That should be explained by
someone who will be here soon.

13:52.700 --> 13:53.950
Priest?

14:00.500 --> 14:03.500
Both of you, what's the matter?

14:15.020 --> 14:16.020
Damn!

14:26.570 --> 14:27.570
Who...

14:29.950 --> 14:31.750
Who are you?

14:31.780 --> 14:33.530
What do you want?

14:34.080 --> 14:35.660
Why did you raid our village?

14:37.160 --> 14:38.460
Why did you kill everyone?

14:44.460 --> 14:45.640
Kid!

14:45.670 --> 14:46.670
What?

14:49.630 --> 14:51.650
You feel soft.

14:51.680 --> 14:53.010
Shame on you!

14:54.850 --> 14:56.560
- Let's run.
- What?

15:04.320 --> 15:07.500
Hey, kid. Do you
know this area well?

15:07.530 --> 15:08.500
Of course I do.

15:08.530 --> 15:10.490
Then lend me your knowledge.

15:28.340 --> 15:29.720
<i>Dye ShOP.</i>

15:37.720 --> 15:39.730
<i>Inn.</i>

15:42.100 --> 15:43.310
Nothing to eat.

15:44.230 --> 15:45.230
I didn't think so.

15:50.740 --> 15:54.370
Don't worry. I won't eat you.

16:02.250 --> 16:05.630
Well, what a gigantic cat!

16:07.670 --> 16:09.730
Jubei Kibagami.

16:09.760 --> 16:15.260
Give me the Sacred Dragon
Stone, and I will spare your life.

16:15.680 --> 16:20.100
Don't you know it's
not polite to steal?

16:20.390 --> 16:23.320
It was ours to begin with.

16:23.350 --> 16:26.480
You're the one who stole it.

16:26.810 --> 16:30.110
No. I'm holding it for someone.

16:30.940 --> 16:34.110
A promise between two men.

16:35.160 --> 16:36.530
You fool.

17:25.370 --> 17:27.140
Hey, he's gaining on us!

17:27.170 --> 17:28.550
Is it okay like this?

17:28.580 --> 17:29.640
Hell if I know!

17:29.670 --> 17:31.670
Ask that crummy priest!

18:41.240 --> 18:43.210
What do you say now?

18:43.240 --> 18:45.420
It's not too late yet.

18:45.450 --> 18:46.790
Give me the Stone!

18:48.290 --> 18:50.790
I... will... not.

20:13.000 --> 20:14.630
Close call.

20:15.840 --> 20:17.090
Was it?

20:48.080 --> 20:49.870
Well, well.

20:50.290 --> 20:54.040
So, young lady, what
are you going to do now?

20:54.920 --> 20:57.590
I want... to know...

20:58.710 --> 21:00.300
more about myself.

21:02.510 --> 21:04.630
I remember what Genza told me.

21:05.380 --> 21:09.100
"If anything happens to the
village, go to the village of Yagyu."

21:11.470 --> 21:16.100
Then maybe you
should go to Yagyu first.

21:16.350 --> 21:17.700
I have an idea.

21:17.730 --> 21:20.400
I'll accompany you if you wish.

21:21.150 --> 21:22.080
Me, too.

21:22.110 --> 21:24.250
No, you're just a burden.

21:24.280 --> 21:25.830
Are you kidding?

21:25.860 --> 21:28.960
It was me who told
you about this waterfall!

21:28.990 --> 21:32.380
I'm worried about
her, so I'm going, too.

21:32.410 --> 21:37.080
No matter where you go, people
are people, and the sky is the sky.

21:45.720 --> 21:49.550
What a nuisance I ended up with.

23:30.150 --> 23:32.160
<i>Next Episode.</i>

23:32.990 --> 23:36.160
Shigure heads to Yagyu
alongside Tsubute and Dakuan.

23:36.910 --> 23:40.550
Yet Jubei must still deliver
the Stone to the Light Maiden.

23:40.580 --> 23:43.390
When these two points
converge into one,

23:43.420 --> 23:45.880
Jyashi of the Kimon Clan
unleashes his technique.

23:46.420 --> 23:50.440
Can Jubei win when his
swordsmanship fails him?

23:50.470 --> 23:53.360
And where is he
hiding the Stone?

23:53.390 --> 23:57.150
Next time on Ninja
Scroll: Forbidden Love.

23:57.180 --> 23:57.360
<i>Episode 3 Forbidden Love.</i>

23:57.390 --> 23:58.400
<i>Episode 3 Forbidden
Love Witness.</i>

23:58.430 --> 24:00.140
<i>Episode 3 Forbidden Love</i>
